  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This rune emulates the deceptive magic of some cloud giants. While wearing or carrying an object inscribed with it, you have Advantage on Dexterity (Sleight of Hand) and Charisma (Deception) checks. In addition, when you or a creature you can see within 30 feet of you is hit by an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to invoke the rune and choose a different creature within 30 feet of you, other than the attacker. That creature becomes the target of the attack, using the same roll, whatever the attack's range.</p><p>Once you invoke this rune, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or Long Rest (twice per rest with Master of Runes). If the rune requires a saving throw, your Rune Magic save DC equals 8 plus your Constitution modifier and Proficiency Bonus.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
